  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Brakeman's Blues** (1 other source): Billy sings this one solo after the band leaves the stage for intermission [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Little Sadie**: back after 113 archived shows (849 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **I'll Rember you, Love**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **The Brakeman's Blues**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-11-15.CAPTGREG.FLAC24** (recommended): audience recording; 22 songs; 127 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The uploader says few tapers were present at this State Theatre show in Portland, so the recording should be a rare find [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-11-15.CAPTGREG.FLAC24**: taped by Capt. Greg; transferred by Capt. Greg; source: AUD [1]. Also: Taped live from the audience as billystrings2021-11-15.CAPTGREG.FLAC24, with the State Theatre's permission to record [1]",
